[
  {
    "Id": 1301,
    "Name": "验收·三顾茅庐",
    "DebugLog": true,
    "Category": "History",
    "Description": "【Phase 1 验收事件 2】同一事件重复触发三次，每次演出不同，第三次让诸葛亮出山加入势力。\n覆盖能力：JobSettled 触发、MaxFireCount=3 次数上限、FireCountCompare 分流三套演出（一份 JSON 演三遍）、**Picture 图文演出（只插在第三顾的正戏上，前两顾扑空不插 —— 避免喧宾夺主、也避免玩家为看空场景多点两次）**、ForceGovernor 槽位（ScopeSlot 引用势力槽）、PersonBelongCheck 带 CitySlot 的归属校验、FlagCheck、Branch 条件分支、Choice 选择肢、**PersonJoinForce 武将加入势力（不走登用判定，内部自动处理 在野/未发现/未登场 三种来源）**、SetFlag。\n\n【触发前提：诸葛亮还没出仕】条件是 or 三选一（任一满足即可触发）：\n· 在野（Wild）且人在 TargetCity；\n· 未发现（Invisible）且人在 TargetCity；\n· 未登场（Unappear）—— 这类人物没有归属城，所以单独一支、不校验城市。\n只要他已经在任何势力仕官，三种状态都不成立，本事件不会触发。\n\n【为什么用 JobSettled 而不是 JobFinished】OnPersonActionOver 是通用信号、不带结果，且在旧演出（CityPersonSearchingEvent）**执行期间**就抛出来，此刻启动本事件会与旧演出抢 GameDialog；JobSettled 在探索演出**彻底结束之后**才抛，不会撞车。\n\n【为什么本事件不加 JobResults 过滤】本事件关心的是\"玩家又去打听了一次\"，而不是\"这次打听到什么\"，因此任一结果都推进一顾。另一层现实原因：本测试剧本里诸葛亮已仕官于势力 2，不满足\"在野 / 未发现 / 未登场\"的新条件，验收前需要先改他的状态（或改用真实历史剧本），否则事件不会触发。真实历史剧本里应改为 JobResults:[0]（即\"这次打听到的是诸葛亮\"）。\n\n触发方式：玩家势力执行\"探索人才\"（人事指令）结算后触发。也可在调试面板强制触发以快速验收三次演出。\n针对剧本：测试剧本-英雄集结（Id 999）。\n\n【设计说明】FireCountCompare 比的是\"本次是第几次触发\"。第一次 <= 1 → 一顾；第二次 == 2 → 二顾；其余 → 三顾。",
    "Enabled": true,
    "Priority": 250,
    "Level": "Critical",
    "Mode": "Semihistorical",
    "Interrupt": true,
    "Trigger": {
      "Kind": "JobSettled",
      "Scope": "PlayerForce",
      "Once": false,
      "MaxFireCount": 3,
      "CooldownTurns": 0,
      "Chance": 100
    },
    "Slots": [
      {
        "Key": "ActionForce",
        "Type": "Force",
        "Source": "PlayerForce",
        "Optional": false,
        "Label": "玩家势力"
      },
      {
        "Key": "ActionPerson",
        "Type": "Person",
        "Source": "ForceGovernor",
        "ScopeSlot": "ActionForce",
        "Optional": false,
        "Label": "君主（刘备）"
      },
      {
        "Key": "TargetCity",
        "Type": "City",
        "Source": "Fixed",
        "SourceArg": "31",
        "Optional": false,
        "Label": "江陵（本剧本中诸葛亮所在城，作为隆中）"
      },
      {
        "Key": "TargetPerson",
        "Type": "Person",
        "Source": "Fixed",
        "SourceArg": "290",
        "Optional": false,
        "Label": "诸葛亮"
      }
    ],
    "Conditions": {
      "Type": "and",
      "Children": [
        { "Type": "FlagCheck", "Params": { "Flag": "ThreeVisitsDone", "Expect": false } },
        {
          "_note": "诸葛亮必须还没出仕：在野 / 未发现 / 未登场，三者满足其一即可",
          "Type": "or",
          "Children": [
            {
              "_note": "在野：Belong 用 Free（判 IsWild），城市用 CitySlot 限定在隆中",
              "Type": "and",
              "Children": [
                { "Type": "PersonStateCheck", "Params": { "Slot": "TargetPerson", "State": "Wild" } },
                {
                  "Type": "PersonBelongCheck",
                  "Params": { "Slot": "TargetPerson", "Belong": "Free", "CitySlot": "TargetCity" }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_note": "未发现：这类人通常没有 BelongCity，所以 Belong 用 Any，只靠 CitySlot 校验位置",
              "Type": "and",
              "Children": [
                { "Type": "PersonStateCheck", "Params": { "Slot": "TargetPerson", "State": "Invisible" } },
                {
                  "Type": "PersonBelongCheck",
                  "Params": { "Slot": "TargetPerson", "Belong": "Any", "CitySlot": "TargetCity" }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_note": "未登场的人没有归属城，因此这一支不校验 TargetCity",
              "Type": "PersonStateCheck",
              "Params": { "Slot": "TargetPerson", "State": "Unappear" }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "Stages": [
      {
        "Op": "Branch",
        "Params": {
          "Conditions": { "Type": "FireCountCompare", "Params": { "Op": "<=", "Value": 1 } },
          "Target": "visit1"
        }
      },
      {
        "Op": "Branch",
        "Params": {
          "Conditions": { "Type": "FireCountCompare", "Params": { "Op": "==", "Value": 2 } },
          "Target": "visit2"
        }
      },
      { "Op": "Jump", "Params": { "Target": "visit3" } },

      { "Op": "Label", "Params": { "Name": "visit1" } },
      {
        "Op": "TalkWindow",
        "Params": { "Text": "第一次拜访 {:TargetCity}。" }
      },
      {
        "Op": "Talk",
        "Params": {
          "Slot": "ActionPerson",
          "Style": "ClickPersonSay",
          "Lines": [
            { "Text": "请问孔明先生可在？" }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "Op": "TalkWindow",
        "Params": { "Text": "书童：先生一早就出门去了，不知何时归来。" }
      },
      {
        "Op": "TalkWindow",
        "Params": { "Text": "刘备怅然而返。" }
      },
      { "Op": "Jump", "Params": { "Target": "end" } },

      { "Op": "Label", "Params": { "Name": "visit2" } },
      {
        "Op": "TalkWindow",
        "Params": { "Text": "时值隆冬，第二次拜访 {:TargetCity}。" }
      },
      {
        "Op": "TalkWindow",
        "Params": { "Text": "家人：家兄访友去了，归期不定。" }
      },
      {
        "Op": "Talk",
        "Params": {
          "Slot": "ActionPerson",
          "Style": "ClickPersonSay",
          "Lines": [
            { "Text": "既如此，备留下一封书信，望先生过目。" }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "Op": "TalkWindow",
        "Params": { "Text": "刘备留下书信，第二次失望而归。" }
      },
      { "Op": "Jump", "Params": { "Target": "end" } },

      { "Op": "Label", "Params": { "Name": "visit3" } },
      {
        "Op": "Picture",
        "Params": {
          "Image": "three_visits",
          "Title": "三顾茅庐",
          "Text": "新春，{:ActionPerson}第三次来到{:TargetCity}。\n这一次，先生在家。",
          "MinSeconds": 2.0,
          "PauseBgm": true
        }
      },
      {
        "Op": "Talk",
        "Params": {
          "Slot": "TargetPerson",
          "Style": "ClickPersonSay",
          "Lines": [
            { "Text": "将军三顾草庐，亮愧不敢当。" },
            { "Text": "今曹操拥百万之众，孙权据有江东；将军可占人和、取荆益，成鼎足之势。" }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "Op": "Talk",
        "Params": {
          "Slot": "ActionPerson",
          "Style": "ClickPersonSay",
          "Lines": [
            { "Text": "先生之言，令备茅塞顿开！愿先生出山相助！" }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "Op": "Choice",
        "Params": {
          "Options": [
            { "Text": "拜请孔明出山", "Next": "recruit" },
            { "Text": "容后再议", "Next": "end" }
          ]
        }
      },

      { "Op": "Label", "Params": { "Name": "recruit" } },
      {
        "Op": "Effect",
        "Params": {
          "Effects": [
            {
              "_note": "用「武将加入势力」而不是「登用武将」：这是感召出山，不是登用判定、也不需要登用者；它内部会处理 在野 / 未发现 / 未登场 三种来源状态，因此不再需要 PersonSetVisible、PersonSetLoyalty",
              "Type": "PersonJoinForce",
              "Params": {
                "Slot": "TargetPerson",
                "ForceSlot": "ActionForce",
                "CitySlot": "TargetCity",
                "Loyalty": 100
              }
            },
            {
              "Type": "SetFlag",
              "Params": { "Flag": "ThreeVisitsDone", "Value": true }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "Op": "Message",
        "Params": { "Text": "{:TargetPerson}加入了{:ActionForce}的麾下！" }
      },

      { "Op": "Label", "Params": { "Name": "end" } },
      { "Op": "End" }
    ],
    "Variables": {}
  }
]
